$DIR/main.p:18:4: packed type must be the type of a type definition: type P packed { ... }
    A packed type can only be the type of a type definition. Its fields are
    reached through its name, and its layout is fixed by that one declaration.
    Define the packed type and use its name:
        type Ctl packed uint8 {
            ...
        }

        var c Ctl
    (see "packed types" in the Plutonium spec, section 7.14)
    (run "pluto explain E2104" for a longer explanation)

